From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:56:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/54] Make every fossil Pokemon obtainable

- Mt. Moon: Miguel no longer takes the other fossil, so both can be picked up
- Root and Claw Fossil item balls in Sevault Canyon
- Cinnabar Lab offers to revive each fossil you carry, including Root (Lileep)
  and Claw (Anorith), and no longer stops after the Amber + one Mt. Moon fossil

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
